==Frontier Access==
[[File:Frontier Access HGSS.png|thumb|Frontier Access]]

The [[Frontier Access]] leads north from {{rt|40|Johto}} to the {{gdis|Battle Frontier|IV}}. It is a small town that sprang up as a staging area for Trainers looking to test their skills in the Battle Frontier. There are also shops where [[Battle Point]]s may be redeemed. The area is first accessible after entering the [[Hall of Fame]].

